                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W6115C00                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  EPLUS PROGRAM TO READ FILE W611.W611V1.W6115B(0) AND  *        
*                PRINT THE RECORDS TO FILE W611.W611V1.W6115C(+1)      *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  UMESH JAIN                                            *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W6115CD1                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W6115B01  '6115B-'                                                             
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W6115CD2  PRINTER VB (133 0)                                               
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
* STEG 1. READ FILE W6115B(0)                                                   
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT W6115CD1                                                              
   PRINT CDC-LISTA                                                              
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
REPORT CDC-LISTA  PRINTER W6115CD2 LINESIZE 128 DTLCTL FIRST                    
TITLE 1  'VCCS  VARNINGSLISTA, OLIKA LEDTID - SAMMA STATUS'  +                  
         ' W6115C-001 '                                                         
HEADING  6115B-DUB-IDDC        ('DC')                                           
HEADING  6115B-DUB-ADINLOMR    ('PLAC')                                         
HEADING  6115B-DUB-KDINLUPF    ('STATUS')                                       
HEADING  6115B-DUB-KVTID-NORM  ('NORM TID')                                     
HEADING  6115B-DUB-KVTID-PRIO  ('PRIO TID')                                     
*                                                                               
LINE  1  6115B-DUB-IDDC             +                                           
         6115B-DUB-ADINLOMR         +                                           
         6115B-DUB-KDINLUPF         +                                           
         6115B-DUB-KVTID-NORM       +                                           
         6115B-DUB-KVTID-PRIO                                                   
                                                                                
